# The drone an octave down used to fold the top half of GLO back onto the bottom.
# One shared lift keeps key 8 above key 1, and the last key above that.
# Seed 42 is Ab dorian. LFO is the drone. OCT- there is its octave.
seed 42
reboot
wait 40
tap GLO
wait 80
tap LFO
wait 40
expect view 6
expect par23 0
tap OCT-
wait 40
expect par23 -1
expect par71 8
expect par72 1
key w0 down
wait 40
expect held 1
expect handnote 32
key w0 up
wait 40
key w7 down
wait 40
expect held 1
expect handnote 44
key w7 up
wait 40
key w15 down
wait 40
expect held 1
expect handnote 58
key w15 up
wait 40
expect held 0
